1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,220
Let's look at the qualities

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:04,140
of a best employee.

3
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,840
I am Dr. Hyma Prasad,

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,520
Psychologist.

5
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:12,380
How should an employee,

6
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:14,880
that is, a person,

7
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,620
behave at work?

8
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:20,060
They must communicate well.

9
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:23,320
Speak properly with everyone.

10
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,860
Then, show gratitude

11
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,680
towards the job.

12
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:30,680
Nowadays, many people

13
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,740
desperately want a job,

14
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:35,140
but once they get it,

15
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,960
they express dissatisfaction

16
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:39,840
about having that job.

17
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,660
Instead, be grateful to God

18
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:45,480
for giving this job.

19
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,980
Treat your work like worship

20
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,880
and show gratitude.

21
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:52,320
Along with that,

22
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,120
have true dedication.

23
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:56,660
Finish work without delays.

24
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:59,980
Demonstrate your full ability

25
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:02,460
and prove your potential.

26
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:04,900
Also, learn new skills

27
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:07,240
and cultivate patience.

28
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:10,380
Trainers may get annoyed,

29
00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:12,820
scold you, or get irritated.

30
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:15,640
Stay patient with them,

31
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:18,460
learn your work thoroughly,

32
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:21,340
and develop your skills.

33
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:24,140
Once skills develop,

34
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:26,820
interest in the job

35
00:01:26,820 --> 00:01:28,820
naturally increases.

36
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:31,240
Any employee who

37
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:33,380
nurtures these qualities

38
00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:35,800
will automatically

39
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:38,240
love their job.

40
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:40,740
Embrace every challenge

41
00:01:40,740 --> 00:01:43,140
in your job willingly.

42
00:01:43,140 --> 00:01:45,880
When you do that,

43
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:48,620
whatever position you desire,

44
00:01:48,620 --> 00:01:51,360
you can easily achieve.

